    <text>
        <body>
<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2168_8127.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser freuendtlich willig dienst zuvor, fuersichtige
<lb n="2"/>ehrsame und weise, besonders liebe guete freuend
<lb n="3"/>und nachbarn.
<lb n="4"/>Es langt uns glaubwuerdig ahn, wie das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ft</unclear>.
<lb n="5"/>burger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ordinari</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Nuernberger</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bott</unclear>, <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Christof</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Sprueder</unclear></persName>, <date resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sambstags</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">20</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">diß</unclear></date> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear>
<lb n="7"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">landtvoegtischen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wacht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Obersilgoew</unclear></placeName>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwischen</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Rauenstain</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">undangen</unclear>, (<unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unsers</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">burgers</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><persName resp="#ner">Thoman <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schreiynogels</unclear></persName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seeligen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">knaben</unclear>, so auch
<lb n="10"/>geritten) angesprengt, und, under anderm,
<lb n="11"/>von dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gerichtswaibel</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alda</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ainen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roten</unclear>
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bart</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soll</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haben</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geredt</unclear> worden, (wenn die
<lb n="13"/>von <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-24" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Lindaw</placeName> ihne mehr, wie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschehen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reueter</unclear>
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zueschicken</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">so</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">woellen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bauren</unclear>, ob es schon
<lb n="15"/>die oberkait nicht befehlen wuerde, hinauff
<lb n="16"/>ziehen und die statt under und ueber sich kehren.
<lb n="17"/>Wann uns dann daran gelegen, diser reden
<lb n="18"/>und deß uebrigen verlauffs zue gedachtem Ober-
<lb n="19"/>silgoew, mehrern und gruendtliche wissen-
<lb n="20"/>schafft <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuehaben</unclear>: <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Allß</unclear> gelangt an
<lb n="21"/>E. Ft. unser ganz freuendt: und fleissig bitt,
<lb n="22"/>sie woellen gedachten ihren burger hierueber,
<lb n="23"/>mittelst aines burgerlichen aidts, aigent-
<lb n="24"/>lich vernemmen, und uns dessen urkhund,
<lb n="25"/>und dero statt insigel ueberschulich zue-
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2168_8128.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">khommen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>, unnd dero, seiner zeit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">not</unclear>-
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">tuerfftigclich</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuogebrauchen</unclear> haben.
<lb n="28"/>Das <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begehrn</unclear> wir inn dergleichen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anderem</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jederzeit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohnvergeßlich</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuobeschulden</unclear>, wie
<lb n="30"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dann</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Vt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohne</unclear> das zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beharrlicher</unclear>
<lb n="31"/>gueter <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nachbarschafft</unclear>, wol <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beigethon</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verbleiben</unclear>,
<lb n="32"/>datum, <origDate when="1619-11-29" resp="#ner">29. novembris <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">a°</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">x</unclear>. 1619</origDate>
<lb n="33"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geheime</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">deß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rhats</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Lindaw</unclear></orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2168_8129.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_2168_8130.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="35"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Denen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fuersichtigen</unclear> ersamen und weisen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burger-
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maister</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Rhatmanen</unclear> der Statt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> St.
<lb n="37"/>Gallen</orgName>, unsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">besonders</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guoten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freunden</unclear>
<lb n="38"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachbaurn</unclear>.
</p>
